OL,3,GNEWSAFading city centre art to be
OL,4,Arepainted in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe large fading piece of artwork in
OL,7,FBristol City Centre is due to be
OL,8,Frepainted next summer with a more
OL,9,Fdurable material.
OL,11,FThe "Our Common Ground" artwork was
OL,12,Fpainted on the floor where the
OL,13,Ffountains were in September last year
OL,14,Fbut quickly began to fade away.
OL,16,FIt was painted with a water-based road
OL,17,Fline marking paint. Bristol City
OL,18,FCouncil has now decided to use
OL,19,Fthermoplastics, which was initially
OL,20,Fdiscounted as too expensive.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
